      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋi̱i̱c Yecu kɛ kui̱ tho̱pä luäkä",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Niɛkɛ rɔ̱, /cuarɛ lätkun tin gɔw lät nhiam nath kɛ ɣöö bikɛ yɛ nɛn, kɛ ɣöö mi la̱tdɛ inɔ bia thil muc kä Guurun in te nhial.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä inɔ, mi thöpɛ muckun, /cuarɛ wa̱k ce̱tkɛ min la la̱tkɛ ɛ ji̱ mɛɛtdä gua̱thni pali ji̱ Juudh kɛnɛ rɛy duɔ̱pni, kɛ ɣöö bakɛ liak ɛ naath. Ɛpuc, ɣän la̱rä jɛ yɛ, kɛn cikɛ muckiɛn jek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ji̱n mi tho̱pi mucku, a tet caamdu /ci min la̱tkɛ ɛ tet cuëëcdu ŋäc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä inɔ bi mucku thöp kɛ tɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈, kä Guur in ŋäc tɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈du bɛ ji̱ moc muc.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋi̱i̱c Yecu kɛ kui̱ palä",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä mi palɛ, /cuarɛ bi ce̱tkɛ ji̱ mɛɛtdä, kɛ ɣöö kɛn nhɔakɛ cuɔ̱ŋ kɛnɛ pal gua̱thni pali ji̱ Juudh kɛnɛ röm duɔ̱pni, kɛ ɣöö dëë kɛ nɛn ɛ naath. Ɛpuc, ɣän la̱rä jɛ yɛ, kɛn cikɛ muckiɛn jek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ji̱n, mi pali, wër dueelu, gäk thokdɛ, kä pal Guur nikɛ tɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈, kä Guur in nɛn tɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈du bɛ ji̱ moc muc.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä mi palɛ, /cuarɛ rieet ti ŋuan nyio̱o̱k lɔrä ce̱tkɛ min la̱tkɛ ɛ jur. Kɛ ɣöö carkɛ jɛ i̱ bakɛ liŋ kɛ kui̱ rieetnikiɛn ti ŋuan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Cuarɛ bi ce̱tkɛ kɛ, kɛ ɣöö Guurun ŋäcɛ min görɛ, a /ka̱nɛ jɛ ni thiec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä palɛ inɛ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋi̱i̱c Yecu kɛ kui̱ thëk",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä mi thɛ̈kɛ mi̱th, /cuarɛ gui̱c canä, ce̱tkɛ ji̱ mɛɛtdä, tin la nyuɔthkɛ thëkdiɛn ɛ ba nɛn ɛ naath. Ɛpuc, ɣän la̱rä jɛ yɛ, kɛn cikɛ muckiɛn jek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi thɛki mi̱th, yi̱r wi̱cdu kä lak nhiamdu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ ɣöö /ca thëkdu bi nɛn ɛ naath, ba nɛn ɛ Guur in nɛɛn tɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ni, kä Guur in nɛn tɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ bɛ ji̱ moc muc.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋi̱i̱c Yecu kɛ kui̱ riäŋä",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“/Cuarɛ rɔ̱ dul nyin riäŋä tin nhɔakɛ wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n, kɛ ɣöö ɛ jɛn gua̱a̱th in camkɛ ŋɔaani thi̱n ɛ tor kɛnɛ kɛ̈th, kä to̱l kuëël duël kä kualkɛ ŋɔaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duɔ̱lɛ rɔ̱ nyin riäŋädun tin nhɔakɛ cieŋ nhial, kɛ ɣöö ɛ jɛn gua̱a̱th mi /ci tor kɛnɛ kɛ̈th ŋɔaani a cam thi̱n, kä /ci kuëël duël to̱l kä /ca ŋɔaani kual. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö gua̱a̱th in te ria̱ŋdun thi̱n ɛ jɛn gua̱a̱th in bi lo̱ckun te thi̱n bä.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋi̱i̱c Yecu kɛ kui̱ waŋ in la buay pua̱a̱ny",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Waŋ ɛ jɛn buay pua̱a̱ny. Kä mi gui̱c waŋdu, bi puɔ̱nydu kɛɛliw thia̱a̱ŋ kɛ buay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi /ci waŋdu gui̱c, bi puɔ̱nydu kɛɛliw thia̱a̱ŋ kɛ muth. Kä mi col buay in te rɛydu, bi di̱t muɔ̱th ku lɛ ni̱n ɛdi!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋi̱i̱c Yecu kɛ kui̱ Kuɔth kɛnɛ yio̱w",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Thilɛ ram mi dee kua̱r da̱ŋ rɛw latdi kä, bɛ kɛl nyir, kä bɛ min dɔ̱diɛn nhɔk, kiɛ bɛ lɔcdɛ kɛɛliw ka̱m kɛl, kä bɛ min dɔ̱diɛn cany. Yɛn /cia Kuoth kɛnɛ ria̱ŋ dee latdi kä.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "/Cuarɛ diɛɛr",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ ɣän la̱rä jɛ yɛ, /cuarɛ diɛɛr kɛ tëkdun kɛ mi bia cam, kiɛ kɛ mi bia math, kiɛ pua̱nykun kɛ mi bia la̱th. /Ci di̱t ni tëk kä mi̱eth, kä /ci di̱t ni puɔ̱ny kä bieyni? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guɛcɛ diit nhial, /cikɛ pi̱th kä /cikɛ ŋer, kä /cikɛ ŋɔaani dol lueekni. Kä Guurun in te nhial mi̱i̱thɛ kɛ. /Ci gɔw ni yɛn kä kɛ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛŋadun mi dee diɛɛrɛ tëkdɛ rep kɛ mi tɔt? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛŋu diɛɛrɛ kɛ bieyni mɔ? Carɛ wuɔ̱thkun kɛ do̱ny tuaali, /cikɛ lät kä /cikɛ täk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɣän la̱rä jɛ yɛ, a cäŋɛ Thɔ-lo-mon kɛ gɔɔy puɔnyädɛ kɛɛliw, /ka̱n jɛ runyikä ce̱tkɛ kɛl kä kɛn tuaal ti̱ti̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi runy Kuoth juaac dɔaar ikä, tin tëk kä iruun bakɛ pɛt, /cɛ yɛ bi runyikä bä, yɛn nɛy ti kuiy ŋa̱thdun? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ /cuarɛ diɛɛr i̱, ‘Bia ŋu cam?’ kiɛ i̱, ‘Bia ŋu math?’ kiɛ i̱, ‘Bia ŋu la̱th puɔ̱nydun?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ ɣöö ji̱ ɣɔaa görkɛ ti̱ti̱ diaal, kä Guurun in te nhial ŋäcɛ ɣöö go̱o̱r yɛn ti̱ti̱ diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɔanɛ go̱r ni ciaŋ kuäärä Kuɔth kɛnɛ cuŋkɛ, kä ba ti̱ti̱ diaal ma̱t yɛ bä.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 6:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ /cuarɛ diɛɛr kɛ mi ruɔ̱ni, kɛ ɣöö bi ruun baak kɛ bakdɛ. A riɛk ca̱ŋ ɔ ro̱ŋ kɛ jɛn cäŋɔ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.6.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.6.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
